        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 7,
        "line_end": 8,
        "exact_text": "3. Identify: (1) which employees (by ID) were deleted from the database, and (2) which employee records were modified (include the employee ID, the field that changed, and both the old and new values).\n\n",
